  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The main purpose of this survey was to collect video data to allow an assessment of invertebrate (e.g. corals and sponges) and fish biodiversity within the North East Saglek Bank area (Labrador, Canada), from where there are reports of high coral bycatch. Sampling of deep-water corals and sponges was another objective of the survey at this site."
